# Event payload schema fixture. Exact field/type changes require review and a version decision.

MilestoneAdded|agreement_id:u128,milestone_id:u32,amount:i128|event_schema_v1
MilestoneApproved|agreement_id:u128,milestone_id:u32|event_schema_v1
MilestoneClaimed|agreement_id:u128,milestone_id:u32,amount:i128,to:Address|event_schema_v1
AgreementCreatedEvent|agreement_id:u128,employer:Address,mode:AgreementMode|event_schema_v1
AgreementActivatedEvent|agreement_id:u128|event_schema_v1
EmployeeAddedEvent|agreement_id:u128,employee:Address,salary_per_period:i128|event_schema_v1
PayrollClaimedEvent|agreement_id:u128,employee:Address,amount:i128|event_schema_v1
AgreementPausedEvent|agreement_id:u128|event_schema_v1
AgreementResumedEvent|agreement_id:u128|event_schema_v1
PaymentSentEvent|agreement_id:u128,from:Address,to:Address,amount:i128,token:Address|event_schema_v1
PaymentReceivedEvent|agreement_id:u128,to:Address,amount:i128,token:Address|event_schema_v1
ContractMigratedEvent|from_version:u32,to_version:u32|event_schema_v1
ArbiterSetEvent|arbiter:Address|event_schema_v1
DisputeRaisedEvent|agreement_id:u128|event_schema_v1
DisputeResolvedEvent|agreement_id:u128,pay_contributor:i128,refund_employer:i128|event_schema_v1
AgreementCancelledEvent|agreement_id:u128|event_schema_v1
GracePeriodFinalizedEvent|agreement_id:u128|event_schema_v1
GracePeriodExtendedEvent|agreement_id:u128,additional_seconds:u64,total_extension_seconds:u64,extended_by_owner:bool|event_schema_v1
BatchPayrollClaimedEvent|agreement_id:u128,total_claimed:i128,successful_claims:u32,failed_claims:u32|event_schema_v1
BatchMilestoneClaimedEvent|agreement_id:u128,total_claimed:i128,successful_claims:u32,failed_claims:u32|event_schema_v1
MilestoneFundedEvent|agreement_id:u128,from:Address,amount:i128,total_escrow_balance:i128|event_schema_v1
ExchangeRateUpdatedEvent|base:Address,quote:Address,new_rate:i128,prev_rate:i128,updater:Address,updated_at:u64|event_schema_v1
MultisigConfigChangedEvent|caller:Address,multisig_contract:Address,old_large_threshold:i128,new_large_threshold:i128,old_dispute_threshold:i128,new_dispute_threshold:i128|event_schema_v1
MilestoneRejectedEvent|agreement_id:u128,milestone_id:u32,rejected_by:Address,reason:soroban_sdk::String|event_schema_v1
MilestoneExpiredEvent|agreement_id:u128,milestone_id:u32,locked_amount:i128,expired_by:Address|event_schema_v1
BulkAgreementsPausedEvent|employer:Address,count:u32|event_schema_v1
BulkAgreementsUnpausedEvent|employer:Address,count:u32|event_schema_v1
